      "id": "claim_71e9023f187142b78797ed75d1e5608b",
      "statement": "The browser-targeting change pattern is documented by ADRs 0060 (list_tabs + per-call tabId targeting, stateless), 0062 (thread tabId from MCP input through to chrome.tabs.sendMessage/update with active-tab fallback), 0063 (open_tab tool and open_tab/open_tab_response protocol pair returning the new tabId), and 0064 (capture_screenshot returning MCP JPEG image content from the active tab).",
