    {
      "id": "claim_c5be4aa56764401c93f54d919e882d8f",
      "statement": "The daemon install is platform-aware and restricted to darwin and linux by normalizePlatform: on macOS it writes a LaunchAgent plist (com.redvex.brijio) under ~/Library/LaunchAgents and drives it with launchctl load/unload; on Linux it writes a systemd user unit (brijio.service) under ~/.config/systemd/user and drives it with systemctl --user; config lives in ~/.brijio/.env (mode 0600) and the wrapper binary in ~/.brijio/bin/brijio.",
