      "id": "claim_2034b8b0bcb04ce5824f946f1ac12a49",
      "statement": "The Dockerfile builds a single combined image that runs both the WebSocket and MCP servers under s6-overlay: stage 1 builds tsup-bundled dist/ for @brijio/mcp (keeping ws, zod, and @modelcontextprotocol/sdk external), stage 2 installs production deps and copies s6 service definitions where the brijio longrun service runs node dist/bin/brijio.js from /app under the user bundle, with WEBSOCKET_PORT=8787 and MCP_HTTP_PORT=8788 exposed and tokens auto-generating when empty.",
