      "id": "claim_b81c55db58a0477f93b6571da38a73d4",
      "statement": "docker-compose.yml defines opt-in profiles: brijio (profile runtime) builds from the Dockerfile and maps ports 8787/8788 with token/timeout env passthrough, browserbridge (profile legacy-runtime) extends brijio, and test-page (profile test) serves clients/test-page via nginx on TEST_PAGE_PORT (default 8080); a plain docker compose up starts nothing because profiles are required.",
